flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/a-mask-whose-host-path-is-deep-in-another-writable-bind.zon: flong.box masks /ro/token (in the writable bind of /srv/shared), two or more levels below the root of a writable bind. A session that can write the host directory can rename the masked file's parent and leave a decoy for the mask to cover, and the file shows through at the new name. Mask at most one level below the root of the writable bind named, or make that bind read-only.
